#. generated by gettext_extract_pot_p4
#: bin/marionnet.ml:540
msgid ""
"Run directories left in %s by past sessions: %d. Each holds the working copy "
"of a project that was not saved, which is why Marionnet never removes any of "
"them by itself; some may even belong to another Marionnet running right now. "
"You may sort them out whenever you like, with the command:\n"
"\n"
"marionnet-cleanup --archive-dirs DIRECTORY --purge-dirs\n"
"\n"
"which first saves each of those projects as a .mar file into DIRECTORY, then "
"removes the directories it could save.%s"
msgstr ""
"Adresáre relácií zanechané v %s: %d. Každý z nich obsahuje pracovnú kópiu "
"projektu, ktorý nebol uložený; preto Marionnet nikdy žiadny sám neodstráni. "
"Niektoré môžu dokonca patriť inému práve bežiacemu Marionnetu. Poradiť si s "
"nimi môžete kedykoľvek sami, príkazom:\n"
"\n"
"marionnet-cleanup --archive-dirs ADRESÁR --purge-dirs\n"
"\n"
"ktorý najprv uloží každý z týchto projektov ako súbor .mar do ADRESÁRA a "
"potom odstráni tie adresáre, ktoré sa mu podarilo uložiť.%s"

